  "title": {
   "en": "The Dying Villainess Denies Adoption"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "시한부 악녀는 입양을 거절합니다"
   },
   {
    "ko-ro": "Sihanbu Angnyeoneun Ibyangeul Geojeolhamnida"
   },
   {
    "en": "A Terminally-Ill Villainess Refuses to Be Adopted"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Terminally-Ill Villainess Refuses Adoption"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Villain Refuses Adoption"
   },
   {
    "es-la": "La enferma terminal rechaza la adopción"
   },
   {
    "ru": "Неизлечимо больная злодейка отказывается быть усыновленной"
   },
   {
    "ja": "余命わずかなので養子はお断りします"
   },
   {
    "zh": "短命恶女拒绝领养"
